# Business Branding

- Store business branding in the database and expose it through a small set of CSS variables.
- Use `--primary-color` as the canonical brand token and derive softer surfaces from it in CSS.
- Apply per-business branding only where there is a concrete business context, especially public business pages.
- Avoid leaking a business theme into global admin or cross-business dashboards.
- Validate any user-provided branding inputs and keep sensible fallbacks for legacy businesses.
